Fix highly parallel builds, set nvcc's --keep directory by the output object

The --keep flag writes intermediates named from the source stem into the cwd,
which under Bazel is shared by every action. The PIC and non-PIC compiles
collide, and ptxas reads a half-written .ptx, boom, broken build.
